    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C4-Clicker: First Mint is a ridiculous 2-in-1 hybrid game where you\u2019ll click your way through the crypto underworld while farming parody coins and vault monsters who never sold the top \u2014 and now you\u2019re here to collect.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Click through the dip and collect absurd coins like XRPlease, BTG, and ChartGoblin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Unlock the Vault, send your party into battle, and auto-farm legendary gear to boost your yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Trade items on the Steam Market, chase rare drops, or just\u2026 keep waiting. (Still waiting.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    It\u2019s half idle clicker, half parody RPG \u2014 all degen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    HODL tight. This market only goes sideways.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C4-Clicker: First Mint is a ridiculous 2-in-1 hybrid game where you\u2019ll click your way through the crypto underworld while farming parody coins and vault monsters who never sold the top \u2014 and now you\u2019re here to collect.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Click through the dip and collect absurd coins like XRPlease, BTG, and ChartGoblin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Unlock the Vault, send your party into battle, and auto-farm legendary gear to boost your yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Trade items on the Steam Market, chase rare drops, or just\u2026 keep waiting. (Still waiting.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    It\u2019s half idle clicker, half parody RPG \u2014 all degen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    HODL tight. This market only goes sideways.</p>",
